+### §check-fails-closed — command failures abort the check
+- Since: 2026-10-23
+- Decision: `set -euo pipefail`. A failing command aborts the check with a non-zero status.
+- Override: The maintainer explicitly overrode the previous fail-open decision and requested fail-fast behavior.
+- Previous reason: with `set -e`, a `wc` failure on a staged-then-deleted file aborted the check and blocked every commit
+  in the repository for a day (2026-09-10). The check was advisory by design.
